No datasets or model weights are redistributed in this repository; they are
accessed at runtime via their own endpoints/APIs under their respective terms.
The pack credits the providers below. Several licenses (CC-BY 4.0, ODbL, the
Copernicus Sentinel Data licence) require attribution wherever the data is used
or its use is disclosed.

Datasets used by the pack (Registry of Open Data on AWS):

  Sentinel-2 Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs    Copernicus Sentinel Data licence
